class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ RFID Smart Cards &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-rfid-cards" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana supports payment, transit, loyalty and identification-card programs with production flows configured for program-specific artwork, data, encoding and issuance requirements. RFID manufacturing is supported by more than 20 years of experience and automated production capability in China and the USA.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Card inlays</span></div><div class="desc">Antenna and chip attach on automated inlay lines, supplied as inlay stock or carried through into finished card production.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Laminated and printed cards</span></div><div class="desc">Inlay lamination, card-body production, printing and finishing to program requirements.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Encoding and personalization</span></div><div class="desc">Chip encoding, unique-ID management and card personalization integrated into the manufacturing flow.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Line verification</span></div><div class="desc">Read/write verification and unique-ID accounting during production before final packout.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See RFID Inlay for the roll-to-roll antenna, chip-attach and converting processes supporting smart-card production.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags/rfid-inlays">Explore RFID Inlay <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">automated RFID inlay lines, card production</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">inlays and straps</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What card programs can Hana manufacture for?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Payment, transit, loyalty and ID card programs, from inlay stock through to finished, personalized cards. Access-control credentials are covered separately on our <a href="/markets/access-control/rfid-cards">Access Control</a> page.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What steps of card manufacturing does Hana run in-house?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana can support inlay build, lamination into the card body, printing and finishing, encoding and personalization, and read/write verification. The applicable manufacturing scope is defined per program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What frequencies do Hana-built cards support?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Contactless card work centers on HF, the standard band for smart cards. Hana's wider RFID manufacturing capability also covers LF and UHF, with the applicable band confirmed for each card program.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/rfid" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the RFID market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your card program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>